---
const staticFeatures = [
  'Carga por debajo de 1 segundo',
  'SEO técnico y metadatos incluidos',
  'Hosting gratuito o de bajo coste',
  'Seguridad: sin base de datos expuesta',
];

const dynamicFeatures = [
  'Panel de administración a medida',
  'Login, roles y permisos de usuario',
  'APIs documentadas y listas para integrar',
  'Contenido editable sin tocar código',
];

const staticTech = ['Astro', 'Next.js', 'React', 'Tailwind CSS', 'JavaScript'];
const dynamicTech = ['Python', 'FastAPI', 'PostgreSQL', 'Strapi', 'Next.js', 'React'];
---

<section id="servicios" class="relative overflow-hidden py-28 sm:py-32">
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="aurora-blob left-[-15%] top-1/4 h-[400px] w-[400px] bg-primary/8"></div>
    <div class="aurora-blob right-[-12%] bottom-0 h-[380px] w-[380px] bg-violet/8 [animation-delay:-8s]"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6">
    <div class="mb-14 flex flex-col gap-8 lg:flex-row lg:items-end lg:justify-between">
      <div class="max-w-2xl" data-reveal>
        <p class="eyebrow">
          <span class="h-px w-8 bg-primary/60"></span>
          Servicios
        </p>
        <h2 class="mt-5 text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.1] tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">
          Dos formas de construir
          <span class="text-gradient"> tu web.</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-text-secondary sm:text-lg">
          No todas las webs necesitan lo mismo. Elegimos la arquitectura correcta
          para tu negocio: máxima velocidad o máxima flexibilidad.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div data-reveal="right" class="lg:pb-1">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/8 bg-white/[0.03] px-4 py-2 font-mono text-[0.68rem] text-text-muted">
          <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>
          Astro · Next.js · FastAPI
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <!-- Web estáticas -->
      <article
        data-reveal
        data-spotlight
        class="spotlight card-glow group relative flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[1.75rem] border border-white/8 bg-surface-light p-7 sm:p-9"
      >
        <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-20 -right-16 h-56 w-56 rounded-full bg-primary/10 blur-3xl" aria-hidden="true"></div>

        <div class="relative z-10 flex items-start justify-between">
          <span class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl border border-primary/20 bg-primary/10 text-primary transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:-rotate-6 group-hover:scale-110">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13 2 3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8Z"/></svg>
          </span>
          <span class="font-mono text-[0.65rem] tracking-widest text-text-muted uppercase">01 / presence</span>
        </div>

        <div class="relative z-10 mt-6">
          <h3 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Web estáticas</h3>
          <p class="mt-1.5 font-mono text-xs tracking-wide text-primary">Velocidad instantánea, cero mantenimiento</p>
          <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
            Sitios corporativos, landings y portfolios generados en build time. Sin servidor
            que mantener, con SEO impecable y Core Web Vitals en verde desde el día uno.
          </p>
        </div>

        <ul class="relative z-10 mt-6 space-y-2.5">
          {staticFeatures.map((feature) => (
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm text-text-secondary">
              <svg class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
              {feature}
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>

        <div class="relative z-10 mt-auto pt-7">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            {staticTech.map((tech) => (
              <span class="rounded-lg border border-white/8 bg-white/[0.03] px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-[0.68rem] text-text-muted transition-colors group-hover:border-white/12 group-hover:text-text-secondary">
                {tech}
              </span>
            ))}
          </div>

          <div class="mt-7 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 border-t border-white/8 pt-6">
            <p class="text-xs text-text-muted">
              <span class="text-text-secondary">Ideal para</span> marcas, landings y catálogos
            </p>
            <a
              href="#contacto"
              class="group/link inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-primary transition-colors hover:text-primary-light"
            >
              Cotizar
              <span class="transition-transform duration-300 group-hover/link:translate-x-0.5">→</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Web dinámicas -->
      <article
        data-reveal
        style="--reveal-delay: 100ms"
        data-spotlight
        class="spotlight card-glow group relative flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[1.75rem] border border-accent/15 bg-surface-light p-7 sm:p-9"
      >
        <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-20 -right-16 h-56 w-56 rounded-full bg-accent/10 blur-3xl" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -bottom-24 -left-16 h-56 w-56 rounded-full bg-violet/10 blur-3xl" aria-hidden="true"></div>

        <div class="relative z-10 flex items-start justify-between">
          <span class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl border border-accent/20 bg-accent/10 text-accent transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:rotate-6 group-hover:scale-110">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><ellipse cx="12" cy="5" rx="9" ry="3"/><path d="M21 12c0 1.66-4 3-9 3s-9-1.34-9-3"/><path d="M3 5v14c0 1.66 4 3 9 3s9-1.34 9-3V5"/></svg>
          </span>
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-accent/20 bg-accent/10 px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-[0.6rem] tracking-widest text-accent uppercase">
            <span class="h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>
            Más solicitado
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="relative z-10 mt-6">
          <h3 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Web dinámicas</h3>
          <p class="mt-1.5 font-mono text-xs tracking-wide text-accent">Datos reales, paneles y usuarios</p>
          <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
            Aplicaciones web con autenticación, base de datos, panel de administración y APIs.
            Contenido que tu equipo gestiona solo, sin tocar una línea de código.
          </p>
        </div>

        <ul class="relative z-10 mt-6 space-y-2.5">
          {dynamicFeatures.map((feature) => (
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm text-text-secondary">
              <svg class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-accent" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
              {feature}
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>

        <div class="relative z-10 mt-auto pt-7">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            {dynamicTech.map((tech) => (
              <span class="rounded-lg border border-white/8 bg-white/[0.03] px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-[0.68rem] text-text-muted transition-colors group-hover:border-white/12 group-hover:text-text-secondary">
                {tech}
              </span>
            ))}
          </div>

          <div class="mt-7 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 border-t border-white/8 pt-6">
            <p class="text-xs text-text-muted">
              <span class="text-text-secondary">Ideal para</span> SaaS, portales y e-commerce
            </p>
            <a
              href="#contacto"
              class="group/link inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-accent transition-colors hover:text-accent-light"
            >
              Cotizar
              <span class="transition-transform duration-300 group-hover/link:translate-x-0.5">→</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>

    <p data-reveal class="mt-10 text-center text-sm text-text-muted">
      ¿No sabes cuál necesitas?
      <a href="#contacto" class="link-underline ml-1 font-medium text-text-primary">Te ayudamos a decidir gratis →</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
